From e26384004a09323b62a33f6fc89e343b44bb7293 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WWE13 Recomp <wwe13-recomp@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:57:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ios: iOS / iPadOS build of the SDK and rex_smoke as an app

- CMake: on iOS skip the host tools (codegen, rexglue CLI) and the unit /
  instruction tests, link FFmpeg statically, install list without them.
- Guest memory: REXGLUE_APPLE_MACH_MEMORY (default ON for iOS, optional on
  macOS) backs the guest page file with a named Mach memory entry
  (mach_make_memory_entry_64) and vm_maps its views, since iOS denies
  shm_open; region queries use vm_region_64 on iOS (no mach_vm.h).
- Vulkan: on iOS the loader is the embedded MoltenVK.framework.
- rex_smoke: iOS app bundle (cmake/ios/Info.plist.in, app.entitlements with
  extended virtual addressing and increased memory limit), embeds
  REXGLUE_IOS_MOLTENVK_FRAMEWORK; reports address-space range
  (task_vm_info), memory available to the app (os_proc_available_memory)
  and a fiber round trip.
- SDL context: no painting while the app is in the background (iOS).
---
